-*- markdown -*-
% mac, caffeinate

# prevent idle sleep (Ctrl+C to stop)
```shell
caffeinate -i
```

# prevent display sleep
```shell
caffeinate -d
```

# prevent sleep for specified seconds (e.g. 1 hour)
```shell
caffeinate -u -t <seconds>
```

# prevent idle sleep while a command is running
```shell
caffeinate -i <command>
```

# prevent all sleep on AC power
```shell
caffeinate -s
```

# wait for a process to exit then release assertion
```shell
caffeinate -i -w <pid>
```
